WEBVTT

00:02.627 --> 00:05.171
How should we kill him?

00:07.215 --> 00:09.134
I can feel the power flowing within me.

00:09.551 --> 00:13.012
I owe it all to our lord
for giving me his blood.

00:14.347 --> 00:17.726
Of course we're going to give him
an agonizing death.

00:20.353 --> 00:21.229
Get down!

00:33.992 --> 00:35.910
So how do we kill him?

00:36.244 --> 00:38.371
Make it agonizing, of course!

02:43.580 --> 02:45.874
It's just like you said, Yahaba.

02:46.082 --> 02:49.460
A house suddenly appeared
from this empty space.

02:51.379 --> 02:55.425
It seems that they used
Blood Demon Arts that can hide entities.

02:57.594 --> 03:01.222
Plus, a demon slayer
is actually with the demons.

03:01.848 --> 03:03.224
What's going on?

03:05.101 --> 03:06.936
This is going to be fun.

03:08.354 --> 03:10.231
By the way, Susamaru.

03:10.732 --> 03:13.651
Should I say that you're immature

03:13.943 --> 03:15.695
or you don't use your brain?

03:16.029 --> 03:17.280
It's so dirty.

03:17.530 --> 03:19.949
My kimono got dirty because of the dust.

03:20.992 --> 03:22.827
You're so noisy.

03:22.994 --> 03:27.040
Thanks to my handball, we found them,
so stop complaining.

03:27.457 --> 03:30.043
I can have fun to the fullest!

03:35.882 --> 03:37.717
You created a mess again.

03:38.092 --> 03:39.677
Stop being uptight.

03:39.928 --> 03:42.263
Your kimono isn't dirty at all.

03:42.847 --> 03:44.182
Anyway...

03:51.064 --> 03:53.358
We found them.

03:54.817 --> 03:55.985
Handball?

03:56.653 --> 04:00.031
She threw the handball
and turned the house into this state.

04:02.492 --> 04:05.620
Is that woman Kibutsuji's subordinate?

04:19.801 --> 04:20.885
Lady Tamayo!

04:26.557 --> 04:27.600
Mr. Yushiro!

04:29.811 --> 04:30.812
Shit.

04:30.895 --> 04:31.854
Nezuko.

04:31.938 --> 04:35.608
Move the woman sleeping inside
to a safe place outside.

04:37.110 --> 04:38.820
Outside is too dangerous.

04:38.987 --> 04:40.822
This house has a basement. Go there.

04:41.239 --> 04:42.323
I understand!

04:42.532 --> 04:43.658
Nezuko.

04:48.329 --> 04:50.164
I killed one.

04:51.207 --> 04:54.669
Their smell is different
from the previous demons.

04:55.295 --> 04:56.504
Are they powerful?

04:56.587 --> 04:57.755
It's a strong smell.

04:57.922 --> 05:00.174
After inhaling the smell,
my lungs felt heavy.

05:09.600 --> 05:15.273
The demon slayer wearing hanafuda earrings
must be you, right?

05:16.274 --> 05:17.817
Are they targeting me?

05:18.818 --> 05:19.777
Ms. Tamayo.

05:19.944 --> 05:22.071
Please retreat to a safe spot.

05:22.322 --> 05:23.990
Their target is me.

05:24.782 --> 05:25.950
Mr. Tanjiro.

05:26.284 --> 05:29.120
Please focus on your battle and not us.

05:29.704 --> 05:31.998
We'll be fine without your protection

05:34.375 --> 05:35.793
because we are demons.

05:37.170 --> 05:38.588
Well then,

05:39.630 --> 05:42.050
let me end your life with this handball!

05:45.678 --> 05:47.764
Even if I dodge it, it will turn.

05:56.481 --> 05:58.441
Among the ten forms,

05:59.067 --> 06:00.777
the fastest slashing move...

06:01.444 --> 06:02.612
Total Concentration Breathing.

06:02.945 --> 06:04.322
Breath of Water!

06:04.947 --> 06:06.032
Seventh Form.

06:06.407 --> 06:08.910
Drop Ripple Thrust Curve.

06:12.955 --> 06:17.168
You striked in an arc
to slow down the handball.

06:18.461 --> 06:19.629
But...

06:24.634 --> 06:26.469
Why does the handball move by itself?

06:27.512 --> 06:31.182
When the handball hit Mr. Yushiro,
it turned in an unnatural manner.

06:32.558 --> 06:35.311
But there's nothing special
about the handball's rotation.

06:35.686 --> 06:36.771
What's this?

06:41.317 --> 06:42.360
Yushiro.

06:43.277 --> 06:44.445
Yushiro.

06:58.835 --> 07:00.294
Lady Tamayo!

07:00.878 --> 07:02.797
I told you already.

07:03.214 --> 07:07.260
I told you we must not get involved
with the demon slayer from the start.

07:07.885 --> 07:10.888
My Blindfold isn't perfect.

07:11.472 --> 07:14.183
You should know that clearly.

07:14.475 --> 07:17.770
Although I could hide the house,
smell, and breath of people,

07:17.937 --> 07:20.523
but the actual existence won't disappear.

07:22.733 --> 07:25.236
More people will leave more traces.

07:25.528 --> 07:28.239
The chance of being discovered
by Kibutsuji is higher as well.

07:29.490 --> 07:31.701
Demons can actually be so close to us.

07:31.951 --> 07:34.120
I didn't smell anything
before they attacked us.

07:35.538 --> 07:37.832
Could it be because
of Mr. Yushiro's Blood Demon Arts?

07:39.208 --> 07:42.753
Anyone who interrupts my time with you.

07:43.171 --> 07:44.714
I hate them.

07:45.631 --> 07:47.341
I really hate them.

07:48.759 --> 07:50.344
I won't forgive them!

07:53.723 --> 07:55.892
What did you say?

07:57.310 --> 07:59.061
This is fun.

07:59.145 --> 08:00.897
This is fun!

08:01.355 --> 08:04.817
You should be honored to be killed by me,

08:04.901 --> 08:07.111
one of the Twelve Demon Moons!

08:07.904 --> 08:09.238
Twelve Demon Moons?

08:10.198 --> 08:12.158
They are direct subordinates of Kibutsuji.

08:20.791 --> 08:22.251
She has more arms now.

08:27.131 --> 08:29.759
All right, let's keep playing.

08:30.092 --> 08:31.844
Until the sun comes up.

08:32.345 --> 08:34.555
Until you die!

08:44.273 --> 08:46.359
If I use my spell now,

08:46.442 --> 08:48.402
it will affect Mr. Tanjiro too.

08:49.320 --> 08:52.657
Plus, Yushiro needs time
to prepare for his attacks.

08:53.908 --> 08:55.076
At this rate...

08:58.746 --> 08:59.789
It happened again.

08:59.872 --> 09:02.625
The handball changed its course
without hitting anything.

09:07.421 --> 09:10.049
Although cutting the handball
minimized its impact,

09:10.341 --> 09:12.385
it still hit me.

09:16.764 --> 09:18.349
There are two kinds of blood smell.

09:18.975 --> 09:20.476
There are two demons.

09:20.685 --> 09:22.520
I can tell their position
based on their smell.

09:23.437 --> 09:24.480
But...

09:29.318 --> 09:31.320
Ms. Tamayo! Mr. Yushiro!

09:32.947 --> 09:33.948
This is bad.

09:34.031 --> 09:35.741
I can't protect them.

09:36.742 --> 09:38.744
Ignore us.

09:39.078 --> 09:40.329
We can heal our wounds.

09:40.413 --> 09:42.456
Hey, useless demon slayer!

09:42.623 --> 09:45.418
You'll know its direction
if you look at the arrow.

09:45.835 --> 09:47.461
Dodge the arrows!

09:47.962 --> 09:49.255
Arrow?

09:50.256 --> 09:53.217
Seriously, you can't even see that?

09:53.926 --> 09:55.886
I'll lend you my sight!

09:56.345 --> 09:59.098
You should be able to chop off
that handball girl's head.

10:12.194 --> 10:13.321
I can see it.

10:13.487 --> 10:15.865
The arrows are guiding the handballs.

10:17.867 --> 10:19.285
They move along the track.

10:22.663 --> 10:24.332
Mr. Yushiro, thank you.

10:24.415 --> 10:26.334
I can see the arrows now!

10:27.084 --> 10:28.836
If that's the case, end it.

10:30.004 --> 10:30.963
Nezuko.

10:31.255 --> 10:32.715
Nezuko, go outside.

10:32.840 --> 10:34.592
I'm leaving the demon on the tree to you.

10:43.809 --> 10:45.686
I'm your opponent.

10:47.021 --> 10:50.983
The demon slayer
wearing hanafuda earrings.

10:51.359 --> 10:52.818
There's no mistake.

10:53.110 --> 10:56.405
I'll definitely bring your head
to our lord.

11:00.660 --> 11:02.328
This is so much fun!

11:09.043 --> 11:11.128
Nezuko, haven't you found him?

11:24.183 --> 11:25.226
They disappeared.

11:27.770 --> 11:29.105
Breath of Water.

11:36.529 --> 11:37.738
Third Form.

11:38.114 --> 11:39.407
Flowing Dance.

11:43.661 --> 11:44.829
Ms. Tamayo!

11:45.037 --> 11:48.165
Are these two demons
very similar to Kibutsuji?

11:48.958 --> 11:50.126
I'm afraid you're right.

11:50.668 --> 11:54.588
Then, I'll harvest their blood for you.

11:59.677 --> 12:02.179
I have two favors to ask from you.

12:03.055 --> 12:04.181
Firstly,

12:04.390 --> 12:07.059
I want your approval
to examine your sister's blood.

12:07.643 --> 12:08.686
Secondly,

12:08.894 --> 12:12.398
I hope you can try your best
to harvest the blood from demons

12:12.481 --> 12:14.692
who have a thick amount
of Kibutsuji's blood.

12:15.901 --> 12:19.405
As for the demons who have
a thick amount of Kibutsuji's blood,

12:19.864 --> 12:24.201
those are demons who are almost
as powerful as Kibutsuji.

12:24.869 --> 12:28.080
It's not going to be easy
to harvest blood from them.

12:30.958 --> 12:32.334
Third Form.

12:32.543 --> 12:33.961
Flowing Dance.

12:38.132 --> 12:39.383
Ms. Tamayo!

12:39.550 --> 12:42.845
Are these two demons
very similar to Kibutsuji?

12:43.429 --> 12:44.722
I'm afraid you're right.

12:56.525 --> 12:59.069
You said you wanted to harvest our blood.

12:59.570 --> 13:02.364
I don't know what the heck
you're trying to do.

13:03.073 --> 13:07.328
I won't allow you to do such a thing
that will enrage our lord.

13:10.414 --> 13:14.835
If you think you can harvest my blood,
one of the Twelve Demon Moons,

13:15.002 --> 13:16.712
come at me then.

13:17.254 --> 13:18.672
Watch out!

13:18.839 --> 13:20.716
You must not let your guard down.

13:21.091 --> 13:23.677
If they are really part
of the Twelve Demon Moons,

13:23.969 --> 13:25.471
without a doubt,

13:25.554 --> 13:28.516
they'll be harder to deal with than
the demons you defeated before.

13:28.849 --> 13:30.768
Yes, I understand.

13:31.101 --> 13:32.311
I'll stay alert.

13:32.394 --> 13:33.771
I won't let my guard down.

13:33.896 --> 13:35.022
I'll defeat them first.

13:35.231 --> 13:36.315
So far...

13:36.857 --> 13:38.442
Yes, I'll try my best!

13:39.360 --> 13:40.528
Lady Tamayo.

13:41.153 --> 13:43.364
Let's use them as decoys and run away now.

13:45.115 --> 13:46.325
I'm joking!

13:54.041 --> 13:56.168
Don't splatter dust on me.

13:56.835 --> 13:58.003
It's so dirty!

14:11.392 --> 14:15.187
She grew new arms in a blink of an eye.

14:16.272 --> 14:19.650
Her recovery rate is way faster
than the demon during the Final Selection.

14:22.027 --> 14:25.406
I want to offer your head to our lord.

14:33.080 --> 14:34.039
Nezuko!

14:37.209 --> 14:41.088
Die together, you two!

14:45.467 --> 14:47.052
Are you okay, Nezuko?

14:47.511 --> 14:49.013
Hey, demon slayer!

14:49.972 --> 14:52.433
Take care of that arrow guy.

14:52.600 --> 14:55.227
Leave the handball girl to me and Nezuko.

14:55.603 --> 14:56.812
I understand!

14:57.354 --> 14:58.355
Nezuko.

14:58.439 --> 15:00.232
Don't overexert yourself.

15:15.205 --> 15:16.373
I'm counting on you.

15:17.791 --> 15:18.959
I need their blood.

15:19.251 --> 15:20.669
I must harvest their blood

15:21.003 --> 15:24.048
to finish the medicine
as soon as possible.

15:24.256 --> 15:26.216
Regardless what demon they are,
I'll fight them.

15:26.383 --> 15:28.093
I'll go all out to win!

15:30.930 --> 15:32.139
I see it.

15:32.723 --> 15:33.974
Opening thread.

15:35.434 --> 15:37.853
What a dirty punk.

15:38.437 --> 15:40.022
Don't get near me.

15:43.192 --> 15:45.319
The thread actually broke.

16:01.752 --> 16:02.836
It hurts.

16:02.920 --> 16:05.589
No, it's very painful.

16:16.266 --> 16:17.393
I need to use a move.

16:19.311 --> 16:21.480
I need to use a move
to cushion the impact.

16:21.897 --> 16:23.232
Eighth Form.

16:23.857 --> 16:24.942
Waterfall Basin.

16:43.961 --> 16:45.045
He disappeared.

16:55.681 --> 16:58.100
You hurt Lady Tamayo.

16:58.517 --> 17:00.436
I won't forgive you!

17:01.437 --> 17:02.730
Tamayo?

17:02.980 --> 17:04.314
Susamaru.

17:04.565 --> 17:08.193
Isn't that the traitor, Tamayo,
at your side?

17:08.819 --> 17:10.738
She's really the best souvenir.

17:11.488 --> 17:13.115
Is that so?

17:17.703 --> 17:18.579
Idiot!

17:18.662 --> 17:19.955
You can't kick the ball.

17:30.507 --> 17:32.092
This is fun.

17:32.342 --> 17:34.053
This is so fun.

17:34.845 --> 17:36.597
Kicking isn't a bad idea.

17:37.681 --> 17:38.891
Yahaba.

17:39.183 --> 17:42.269
We might as well bring back
four of their heads.

17:42.853 --> 17:45.022
You're wrong. Two heads are enough.

17:45.606 --> 17:47.566
The demon slayer's and the traitor's.

17:48.275 --> 17:50.235
The other two aren't necessary.

17:52.946 --> 17:54.198
Ms. Nezuko.

17:55.240 --> 17:57.117
The bleeding can't be stopped immediately.

17:57.785 --> 17:59.369
She's recovering too slowly.

18:01.205 --> 18:04.166
This serum can heal your leg.

18:15.719 --> 18:17.012
What should I do?

18:18.263 --> 18:19.765
I cannot lose.

18:21.058 --> 18:24.645
But even if I see the opening thread,
I can't hit him easily.

18:26.021 --> 18:27.064
My moves.

18:27.439 --> 18:31.527
If I couldn't strike exactly
at his weak point, it's pointless then.

18:32.611 --> 18:33.904
Even if I deviate slightly,

18:33.987 --> 18:36.365
the power of my moves
can't be executed fully.

18:37.199 --> 18:41.036
The direction of my attacks
will change because of the arrows.

18:43.122 --> 18:45.415
I feel bad for saying this,

18:45.541 --> 18:47.417
but the eye on his hand is so disgusting.

18:48.043 --> 18:49.419
Forgive my bluntness.

18:57.219 --> 18:59.012
The arrow's speed is very fast.

18:59.680 --> 19:02.391
It won't disappear before touching me.

19:03.225 --> 19:05.269
Plus, my sword can't penetrate it.

19:06.061 --> 19:07.729
When my sword touches the arrow,

19:07.813 --> 19:10.023
I'll be blown away
based on the arrow's direction.

19:16.196 --> 19:17.531
What should I do?

19:26.498 --> 19:28.792
Everything is as I expected.

19:29.042 --> 19:30.878
I want to break your arm.

19:42.306 --> 19:46.143
So, you escaped by doing air flips in the
same direction as my Kouketsu Arrow.

19:47.144 --> 19:48.228
Dirty monkey!

19:49.146 --> 19:51.773
It's not good to continue being defensive.

19:52.191 --> 19:53.400
I must counter attack

19:53.984 --> 19:57.738
without any contact with the arrows
and changing their direction.

19:59.281 --> 20:00.949
It's time for you to die!

20:03.493 --> 20:04.953
I must adapt my moves.

20:06.330 --> 20:09.374
Firstly, I'll use Sixth Form
to wrap around the arrow.

20:12.336 --> 20:14.630
After that, I'll use Third Form
to move quickly

20:15.923 --> 20:17.507
and shorten our distance.

20:22.512 --> 20:23.597
Twisting.

20:23.889 --> 20:25.057
Wrapping.

20:27.476 --> 20:28.685
Whirpool.

20:29.186 --> 20:30.354
Current.

20:36.526 --> 20:38.195
My sword feels heavy.

20:39.738 --> 20:40.906
But...

20:41.490 --> 20:43.533
Second Form Modified.

20:44.826 --> 20:47.204
Lateral Water Wheel.

22:33.477 --> 22:35.187
Those two demons are so strong.

22:35.353 --> 22:38.523
The combined attack of arrows
and handballs are so hard to deal with.

22:38.857 --> 22:40.609
Nezuko, are you okay?

22:42.569 --> 22:46.239
Here's a little gossip about the demons
from the Taisho era.

22:46.448 --> 22:49.534
I heard that Yahaba and Susumaru
met each other for the first time today.

22:49.659 --> 22:53.538
Before they found us,
they talked and got close.

22:54.206 --> 22:56.583
They work well together
despite meeting for the first time.

22:56.666 --> 22:57.709
How surprising.

22:57.876 --> 22:59.711
We mustn't lose to them.

22:59.878 --> 23:02.255
Nezuko, let's practice our combo attack.

23:04.132 --> 23:05.217
First Form.

23:06.426 --> 23:07.469
Second Form.

23:09.096 --> 23:10.263
Third Form.

23:13.517 --> 23:15.310
Not bad, Nezuko.

23:17.312 --> 23:20.148
Next, episode 10, "Together Forever."

23:20.440 --> 23:22.275
I'm leaving the handball girl to you.

23:22.442 --> 23:23.735
Let's fight together.

23:25.278 --> 23:26.530
TO BE CONTINUED

23:26.613 --> 23:27.864
Subtitle translation by Michelle Chai
